⚡🇺🇸🇮🇷Trump admitted that the United States may have gone "too far" in striking the Iranian leadership, making it more difficult to identify counterparts with whom to negotiate. 
"We no longer know who we are really dealing with. We could have stopped at the first level. The second level and the second and a half level were probably an excess," the US president stated during a rally in Ohio.

